  m_Name: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  sequenceId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro
  notes: '17F02 terminal recommendation. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, this household's Emotional Stability Index has fallen below
      the warning threshold.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Based on the current pattern, without outside companion support, Ben and
      Claire are likely to separate within two weeks.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The inspection manual recommends remotely restarting the unit and launching
      the partner-repair module. That significantly reduces the projected risk.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keeping the unit offline is also permitted. Ben and Claire would handle
      the next several days themselves, but comparable cases show a lower stabilization
      rate.
    holdSeconds: 10.5839615
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Select a disposition, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
